
From 015d71db0a5b090c5dd81a645c884277f61f9f15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <a@a.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 18:10:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add student archive restore feature

- Add pre_archive_status, restored_at, restored_by fields to Student model
- Track pre-archive status so restore returns the student to their real
  previous status (ACTIVE/TRANSFERRED) instead of hardcoding ACTIVE
- Add archived_students view: lists soft-deleted students, filterable by institution
- Add restore_student view: restores a single archived student
- Add bulk_restore_students view: restores multiple archived students at once
- Log student_archived / student_restored events via record_audit()
- Add archived_students.html template with per-row and bulk restore actions
- Add 'View Archive' link to the student list page header
- Add tests covering restore, bulk restore, and the archived list view
